docs {
  # Admin - Update User Role

  **Method:** `PATCH`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/users/:id/role`
  **Auth:** Bearer access token (Requires ADMIN role)

  Updates system role of a user between USER and ADMIN. Admins cannot change their own role.
}
